# SIDEWINDER-CORE-HYGIENE-S1: SideWinder's first automated test suite.
# Covers the reusable core only -- deliberately NO database, cloud or auth, so
# this runs anywhere with no services.
-cp Source
-cp tests
-lib utest
-lib hxwell
-D disable_env
-D no-deprecation-warnings
-main TestMain
-cpp bin/tests-cpp
